  "details": "When I often used the smoothing option on the camera, it was to provide stream viewers or my personal recordings with a more fluid cinematic movement. Now, it feels as though my avatar is completely stationary, as if in front of a green-screen. \n\nAdditionally, it restricts the view of the world around myself, which is often the more significant desire; to show more of the view while I am moving.\n\nI acknowledge the desires to keep the camera from moving into the avatar, so this is why an additional toggle feels appropriate for those of us who did want to use the smoothing with locomotion.",
